00:00:21.992 --> 00:00:30.869
Please permit me to tell you everything in Atlantic City.
请允许我告诉你大西洋城的一切。

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.130
Well, hello friends.
嗯，朋友们大家好。

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.642
Hello, it's Josh Radner.
你好，我是乔什·拉德纳。

00:00:33.642 --> 00:00:35.973
I'm here with my friend Craig Thomas.
我和我的朋友克雷格·托马斯在这里。

