Did that ever alarm you guys as a cast Josh, when you would see, when you'd go to bed and the script hasn't shown up even on email, I think there used to be hard copies delivered and it hasn't even been fucking emailed out.
作为演员，乔希，当你看到，当你上床睡觉时，剧本甚至没有出现在电子邮件上，我想曾经有过硬拷贝交付，但它甚至还没有通过电子邮件发出。

